              "value": "Emit Spores"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/day\n\nUmbo expels spores in a 10-foot burst centered on a corner of his own space. This cloud lasts until the start of the myceloid's next turn. Each creature that is in the cloud or enters it is exposed to purple pox."
            },
